{"sha": "57a6a2c59768bcb9172d8ad61c2c95b9954f27c42f975dd587ff355f73ed3172", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:waves-on-strings} 章 --- 弦与杆上的波：达朗贝尔方程}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:1}", "$c = 2Lf = \\qty{143}{m/s}$；$T = \\mu c^2 = \\qty{61}{N}$；弦上 $\\lambda = 2L = \\qty{1.3}{m}$，", "空气中 $340/110 = \\qty{3.1}{m}$；第五品：$110 \\times 2^{5/12} =", "\\qty{147}{Hz}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:2}", "$\\sqrt{E/\\rho}$：钢 \\qty{5.1}{km/s}，铝 \\qty{5.1}{km/s}，铅", "\\qty{1.2}{km/s}。\\qty{1}{km}：沿钢轨需 \\qty{0.20}{s}，经空气需 \\qty{2.9}{s} ——", "先听到的是钢轨传来的声音，两声相隔 \\qty{2.7}{s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:3}", "$400$、$600$、$800$ Hz 分别对应 $1$、$2$、$3$ 个内部波节；第 3 个模式的波节位于", "$L/3$ 和 $2L/3$。$T \\times 2$：$200\\sqrt2 = \\qty{283}{Hz}$；$L/2$：\\qty{400}{Hz}；$\\mu", "\\times 3$：$200/\\sqrt3 = \\qty{115}{Hz}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:4}", "$c = \\sqrt{45/0.2} = \\qty{15}{m/s}$；\\qty{24}{m} 所需时间为 \\qty{1.6}{s}；脉冲返回时", "倒立（$r = -1$）；若为自由端反射，则正立（$r = +1$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:5}", "(a) $\\mu = \\rho\\pi d^2/4 = \\qty{6.1}{g/m}$；$c = 2Lf = \\qty{334}{m/s}$；$T = \\mu c^2 =", "\\qty{690}{N}$。(b) $\\sigma = T/A = \\rho c^2 = \\qty{0.87}{GPa}$，安全裕度 $2.3$。(c) $T/4 =", "\\qty{170}{N}$，应力相同（仅取决于 $\\rho c^2$）。(d) 长弦", "不适用此情形；粗的光滑金属丝刚度过大（强烈的", "非简谐性），也难以绕过桥面；铜绕组增加了质量，", "却不增加刚度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:6}", "(a) $m_n = 4L^2f^2\\mu/n^2g = 6.6/n^2$ kg：$6.6$、$1.65$、$0.73$、\\qty{0.41}{kg}。(b)", "$n^2 = 13.2$，$n = 3.6$：不共振，位于第 3 与第 4 模式之间（最接近者为 4，", "\\qty{0.41}{kg}）。(c) 实际上相当于波节：驱动端的振幅", "与波腹相比极小。(d) 每个周期内能量同相输入，", "并不断累积；阻尼（空气、内摩擦、经滑轮的漏失）", "限制了振幅。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:7}", "$c = \\qty{100}{m/s}$，$k = \\qty{6.3}{rad/m}$，$\\lambda = \\qty{1.0}{m}$；$v_{\\max} = \\omega A =", "\\qty{1.3}{m/s}$，$a_{\\max} = \\omega^2A = \\qty{790}{m/s^2}$；斜率 $kA = 0.013$；$Z =", "\\sqrt{T\\mu} = \\qty{1.0}{kg/s}$；$\\langle\\mathcal P\\rangle = \\tfrac12Z\\omega^2A^2 = \\qty{0.79}{W}$；", "每个波长内 $\\mathcal P/f = \\qty{7.9}{mJ}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:8}", "(a) $c_1 = \\qty{100}{m/s}$，$c_2 = \\qty{50}{m/s}$；$Z_1 = \\qty{0.20}{kg/s}$，$Z_2 = \\qty{0.40}{kg/s}$。", "(b) 由轻弦入射：$r = -1/3$，$t = 2/3$；由重弦入射：$r =", "+1/3$，$t = 4/3$。(c) 两种情形下均有 $R = 1/9$，$\\mathcal T = 4 \\times 0.08/0.36 = 8/9$。", "(d) 透射波：高 \\qty{0.67}{cm}，宽 \\qty{5}{cm}（时长相同，", "速率减半）；反射波：\\qty{-0.33}{cm}，\\qty{10}{cm}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:9}", "(a) $E = F\\ell/A\\Delta\\ell = 80 \\times 2/(7.85 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 10^{-3}) = \\qty{2.0e11}{Pa}$。", "(b) $c = \\qty{5.1}{km/s}$。(c) 纵波：$c/2\\ell = \\qty{1.3}{kHz}$；横波", "$\\sqrt{T/\\mu} = \\qty{114}{m/s}$，$f = \\qty{29}{Hz}$ ——张力使金属丝", "承受 \\qty{100}{MPa} 的应力，相当于 $5 \\times 10^{-4}$ 倍的 $E$，因此横波速率为", "纵波速率的 $\\sqrt{5 \\times 10^{-4}}$ 倍。(d) $k = Ea = \\qty{50}{N/m}$；$m", "= \\rho a^3 = \\qty{1.2e-25}{kg}$（约 $70$ 个原子质量单位）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:10}", "(a) $b_n = \\frac2L\\int_0^Ly(x, 0)\\sin(n\\pi x/L)\\dd x$，其中三角形 $y =", "2hx/L$ 位于 $[0, L/2]$ 上（并关于中点对称）：分部积分得 $b_n = 8h\\sin(n\\pi/2)", "/n^2\\pi^2$。(b) 偶数 $n$ 对应的系数为零：中点是每个偶数模式的波节，", "正是被拨动的点。(c) $E_n = \\tfrac14\\mu L\\omega_n^2b_n^2 \\propto n^2/n^4 = 1/n^2$", "（奇数 $n$）：基频所占比例为 $1/\\sum_{\\text{奇数}}n^{-2} = 8/\\pi^2 = 81\\%$。(d)", "$b_n \\propto \\sin(n\\pi/5)/n^2$：$n = 5, 10, \\dots$ 时为零。靠近桥的位置，", "因子 $\\sin(n\\pi x_0/L)$ 对低阶模式很小，对高阶模式则持续增大：", "高次谐音相对更多，声音更明亮。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:11}", "(a) $-m\\omega^2 = k(2\\cos ka - 2) = -4k\\sin^2(ka/2)$。(b) $v_\\varphi = 2\\omega_0\\sin(ka/2)", "/k$，$v_g = \\omega_0a\\cos(ka/2)$；二者均 $\\to \\omega_0a = c$（当 $ka \\to 0$ 时）；在 $ka = \\pi$ 处：", "$v_\\varphi = 2c/\\pi$，$v_g = 0$。(c) 相邻质点反相运动：这是一个驻波", "，不输运能量；$k$ 超过 $\\pi/a$ 时给出的位移集合与", "某个 $k' = k - 2\\pi/a$ 的相同 ——并无新的波。(d) $\\omega_0 = c/a =", "\\qty{2.0e13}{rad/s}$，$f_{\\max} = \\omega_0/\\pi = \\qty{6.5}{THz}$；对 \\qty{1}{MHz}：$\\lambda =", "\\qty{5.1}{mm} = 2 \\times 10^7a$，$ka \\sim 3 \\times 10^{-7}$：完全无色散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-on-strings:12}", "(a) $T(x) = \\mu gx$，$c = \\sqrt{gx}$。(b) $t = \\int_0^L\\dd x/\\sqrt{gx} = 2\\sqrt{L/g} =", "\\qty{2.0}{s}$；脉冲的上部比下部传播得快，因此", "脉冲被拉长。(c) $c = \\sqrt{T/\\mu}$ 向鞭梢方向增大。(d) 能量 $\\approx", "\\mathcal P\\tau = ZV^2\\tau = \\sqrt{T\\mu}V^2\\tau$ 为常量：$V \\propto \\mu^{-1/4}$；", "$10^4$ 倍的 $\\mu$ 差异使速率增至 $\\times10$，即 \\qty{100}{m/s} ——真实的鞭子还从展开的环中", "获得其余能量，这使能量进一步集中，", "鞭梢超过了声速。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:waves-on-strings:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\mu = \\rho\\pi d^2/4 = \\qty{6.1}{g/m}$；$c = 2Lf = \\qty{334}{m/s}$；$T = \\mu c^2", "= \\qty{685}{N}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\sigma = \\rho c^2 = \\qty{0.87}{GPa}$：安全裕度 $2.3$。$T \\propto f^2$：", "升高半音时增加 $12\\%$，高出一个八度时增至四倍，", "即 \\qty{3.5}{GPa} ——金属丝将断裂。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $230 \\times 685 \\approx \\qty{160}{kN}$，约十六吨。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $c = 2Lf = \\qty{105}{m/s}$；在 \\qty{685}{N} 下：$\\mu = T/c^2 = \\qty{63}{g/m}$，", "即直径 \\qty{3.2}{mm} 的钢杆 ——刚度过大，难以简谐振动，", "也难以绕过桥面；以铜绕制的细芯", "既提供了质量，又不增加刚度。", ""]}